render_lab's story library for Lamlet
=====================================

A storyboard is a Lamlet presentation (`storyboard.lam`, tools/video/README.md), and may import this package
with `$$[Import* render_lab]`: its functions compute narration, numbers spoken as words, so the voice reads them
right. Cues are not written here: they are `present`'s `cue` and `during` with the investigation's vocabulary
(`render-lab story keys`, generated by the video builder). Nothing here runs at playback.

$[Import* std]

Numbers as the voice says them

Narration says its numbers in words, so the voice reads them right: `spoken` writes a non-negative Int in
English words, `spokenFloat` a Float with its decimals ("three point two"), `rounded` an Int to its leading
`digits` significant digits ("about forty-two thousand" is `rounded 42289 2`).

$[# _ones [% {' "zero" "one" "two" "three" "four" "five" "six" "seven" "eight" "nine" "ten" "eleven" "twelve"
                "thirteen" "fourteen" "fifteen" "sixteen" "seventeen" "eighteen" "nineteen"}]]
$[# _tens [% {' "" "" "twenty" "thirty" "forty" "fifty" "sixty" "seventy" "eighty" "ninety"}]]
$[# {_under100 n} {!if {< n 20} {nth _ones n}
        {!if {= {% n 10} 0} {nth _tens {div n 10}}
            {++ {nth _tens {div n 10}} {++ "-" {nth _ones {% n 10}}}}}}]
$[# {_under1000 n} {!if {< n 100} {_under100 n}
        {!if {= {% n 100} 0}
            {++ {nth _ones {div n 100}} " hundred"}
            {++ {nth _ones {div n 100}} {++ " hundred " {_under100 {% n 100}}}}}}]
$[# {_withScale self n unit name} [# r {% n unit}]
    {++ {self {div n unit}} {++ " " {++ name {!if {= r 0} "" {++ " " {self r}}}}}}]
$[# {spoken n}
    {!if {< n 0} {++ "minus " {spoken {neg n}}}
        {!if {< n 1000} {_under1000 n}
            {!if {< n 1000000} {_withScale spoken n 1000 "thousand"}
                {!if {< n 1000000000} {_withScale spoken n 1000000 "million"}
                    {_withScale spoken n 1000000000 "billion"}}}}}]
$[# {_digit c} {withDefault {fold {range 0 10} none {^ {found d} {!if {= {str d} c} {some d} found}}} 0}]
$[# {_digitWords digits} {join " " {map {chars digits} {^ {c} {nth _ones {_digit c}}}}}]
$[# {_toInt digits} {fold {chars digits} 0 {^ {acc c} {+ {* acc 10} {_digit c}}}}]
$[# {spokenFloat x} [# text {str {abs x}}]
    [# parts {split text "."}]
    [# whole {spoken {_toInt {head parts}}}]
    [# sign {!if {< x 0.0} "minus " ""}]
    {!if {= {length parts} 1}
        {++ sign whole}
        {!if {= {nth parts 1} "0"}
            {++ sign whole}
            {++ sign {++ whole {++ " point " {_digitWords {nth parts 1}}}}}}}]
$[# {_pow10 k} {!if {<= k 0} 1 {* 10 {_pow10 {- k 1}}}}]
$[# {rounded n digits} [# size {length {chars {str {abs n}}}}]
    [# step {_pow10 {- size digits}}]
    [# r {* {div {+ {abs n} {div step 2}} step} step}]
    {spoken {!if {< n 0} {neg r} r}}]
